<section class="page-hero compact"><div class="container"><h1>One-time coupon export</h1><p>Batch #<%= issued.batchId %> — <%= issued.percent %>% discount — expiry <%= issued.expiryDate %></p></div></section>
<section class="container section"><div class="alert alert-warning"><strong>IMPORTANT:</strong> These codes are visible ONLY on this page, immediately after issuance. Copy them now to a secure institution contact channel. Never email recipient identity documents with these codes. Reloading or returning will not show codes again.</div>
<div class="panel"><h2>Generated fee waiver codes</h2><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>Number</th><th>Code</th></tr></thead><tbody><% issued.codes.forEach((code,index)=>{ %><tr><td><%= index+1 %></td><td><code><%= code %></code></td></tr><% }); %></tbody></table></div><a href="/admin/fees" class="btn btn-primary">I saved the codes — return to allocations</a></div></section>
